🪙 A top US military official said the government runs a Bitcoin node to test cybersecurity uses of the network

Admiral Samuel Paparo said the military sees Bitcoin mainly as a tool to help secure networks. He also praised stablecoin legislation for helping ensure the global dominance of the US dollar.

