🔥 Analytics firm Vortexa says over 10M barrels of Iranian oil exit Gulf despite blockade

The firm tracked 34 tanker movements in a week, including six loaded shipments carrying about 10.7 million barrels. It remains unclear how much of the oil reached global markets.

